nitudeType":"EG","narrative":"Thunderstorm winds downed several tree branches at a residence 8 miles northwest of Kenel, SD which sits just south of the North Dakota state line. Another residence just over the border had siding removed by these strong winds.","source":"Public","state":"SD","type":"Thunderstorm Wind","wfo":"ABR"},{"begin":"2023-09-05T02:35Z","county":"Kidder","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"300.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2023-09-05T02:42Z","endLat":47.3145,"endLon":-100.0376,"episode":185621,"id":1141334,"injuries":0,"lat":47.3145,"location":"148.12 NE Haynes","lon":-100.0376,"magnitude":87.0,"magnitudeType":"EG","narrative":"A small Park Model mobile, which was on blocks and anchored down, was completely destroyed, with the undercarriage separating from the unit, though the deck remained in its spot with a grill still on it. A 55 gallon barrel of steel scrap was blown over and rolled. Multiple three foot diameter cottonwood trees were damaged, with some uprooted and a few older ones snapped. About one-quarter mile to the east of this location a grain bin was blown across a road, and a shop wall was blown out. Windbreak panels were toppled, with one tossed and flipped over.  All damage was blown toward the north and east, the direction the storm was moving.","source":"Public","state":"ND","type":"Thunderstorm Wind","wfo":"BIS"},{"begin":"2023-09-05T02:40Z","county":"Kidder","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2023-09-05T02:45Z","endLat":47.22,"endLon":-99.56,"episode":185621,"id":1139359,"injuries":0,"lat":47.22,"location":"6.5 NNE Lake Williams","lon":-99.56,"magnitude":52.0,"magnitudeType":"EG","narrative":"Thunderstorm wind gusts were estimated by a trained spotter.","source":"Trained Spotter","state":"ND","type":"Thunderstorm Wind","wfo":"BIS"},{"begin":"2023-09-05T02:40Z","county":"Johnson","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2023-09-05T04:40Z","endLat":43.5663,"endLon":-107.0501,"epi